  "reviewNotes": [
    "Selected MTC revision 07 is a published Internet-Draft, not an RFC. Revision 08 was published on 2 November 2026; its own change log states that revision 07 and 08 have compatible wire formats. Revision 08 is recorded for comparison, not silently selected for preserved evidence.",
    "Revision 07 assigned PKIX OIDs after revision 06 placeholders. Existing signed bytes must not be rewritten merely because a newer draft is published.",
    "The retained mtcEditor snapshot is a historical comparison, not the latest published baseline.",
    "The selected deployment-use-cases source remains informational WG draft-00. Revision 01 was published on 2 November 2026; its section 3.5.5 replaces draft-00's explicit all-published-heads validity floor and separate-infrastructure requirement with general archival-plan guidance. The earlier numeric floor requires independent application-profile selection when reasoning from revision 01."
  ]
